-- הסכם קיבוצי (מסגרת) מיום 18.4.2016: the public-sector framework agreement
-- between the State and the public employers and the New General
-- Histadrut, for the scales the Histadrut represents (annex א'). Its period
-- to 31.12.2017 and whom it covers (§§2–3); the cost frame of
-- 1.1.2013–31.12.2017 (7.5% in all, 1.5% a year), allocated from 1.7.2016
-- (1%), 1.3.2017 (to 2.75%), 1.1.2018 (to 4.25%), 1.6.2018 (to 6%) and
-- 1.12.2018 (to 7.5%), with a one-time grant of 2,000 in two parts (§§4–5);
-- the salary base it is measured on and how, group by group (§§6–7); the
-- minimum wage (§8); the special supplements raised at the frame's rates
-- (§9); "תוספת שקלית 2016", a uniform shekel supplement from 1.7.2016 (§10);
-- further negotiation, the data the Histadrut may ask for, and the special
-- scales (§11); the default allocations of each later step, as "תוספת
-- אחוזית 2016" and the shekel supplement raised (§§12–15); the
-- index-linked supplements brought forward (§16); new technologies (§17);
-- parents' hours at the end of August (§18); budgetary pensioners (§19);
-- the local authorities (§20); the funding of the social workers' agreement
-- of 9.2.2015 (§21); the structure of employment (§22); disputes,
-- exhaustion of claims, industrial peace, earlier agreements, the follow-up
-- committee and the agreed arbitration institution (§§23–28). Annexed: the
-- scales (א'), the accession letter (ב'), the wages commissioner's circulars
-- on the grant's first part (ג'), the special scales' tables (ד'), the scales
-- of §19 (ה'), the coefficient X of §19 (ו') and the disputes that stay
-- pending (ז').
--
-- It covers no teaching employee: the teaching scale is not in annex א'.
-- The Ofek Hadash agreements of 22.2.2016 and 30.9.2016 recite it (the
-- first as the understandings of 23.12.2015 it carries out) and give the
-- teachers a cost of their own; they are held against it in
-- l4/tests/2016-09-30_ofek-hadash_september-2016-agreement-tests.l4. It
-- speaks to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root. Its
-- amendment of 8.8.2016 — the frame to 7.75% and the last steps put off to
-- 1.6.2018, 1.12.2018 and 1.3.2019, a new annex ו' — is encoded beside it
-- and imports it (2016-08-08_framework-agreement_public-sector_amendment);
-- its amendment of 9.1.2018 — the frame to 7.9%, 5.1.4 and 5.1.5 put off to
-- 1.8.2019 and 1.12.2019 — likewise
-- (2018-01-09_framework-agreement_public-sector_amendment). This file is the
-- agreement as signed.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT womens_work_law
IMPORT minimum_wage_law

§ `הסכם קיבוצי (מסגרת) — מסגרת עלות התוספות 2013–2017 (18.4.2016)`

DECLARE `2016 framework action` IS ONE OF
    `notify a change in the calculation group by 30.4.2016`
    `allocate the cost saved by raising a supplement counted for the minimum wage`
    `approve the 2016 shekel supplement's amount in writing`
    `correct a mistake in the 2016 shekel supplement in the next salary`
    `pay the 2016 shekel supplement from the July 2016 salary`
    `pay the July 2016 differences with the August 2016 salary`
    `negotiate an agreement allocating the 2016 cost frame`
    `transfer the salary data the Histadrut asks for under the 2016 framework`
    `examine a request to process salary data under the 2016 framework favourably`
    `declare a dispute or take measures for want of an approved allocation`
    `pay a default allocation of the 2016 framework from its salary month`
    `circulate the bill amending the Pensions Law under the 2016 framework`
    `support the bill amending the Pensions Law under the 2016 framework`
    `demand a further rise of the determining salary for the 2016 frame`
    `give another benefit for the 2016 pensioners' rise`
    `go on discussing the structure of employment under the 2016 framework`
    `negotiate further on pay for the period to 31.12.2017`
    `strike or harm the work over a matter the 2016 framework settled`
    `decide disputes over the 2016 framework agreement`
    `let a parent use the parents' leave in the period of use`
    `pay the one-time grant of 2016`
    `notify the wages commissioner of paying the grant within a month`

