-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 "To"; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 The chief labour-relations officer; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 The Ministry of the Economy and Industry; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p6 The subject: joining the framework agreement of 18.4.2016; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p11 A blank for the date; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p12 A blank for the employer's signature; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p13 A file number; no rule.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p15 The signatures; no rule.

-- The accession letter (§3(ג)): its title; ¶5 and its note ¶14 — for a
-- budgeted or supported body it fits one with no wage agreement for
-- 1.1.2013–31.12.2017, or one for part of it of no more than 6 months; one
-- with an agreement for the period, or for more than 6 months of it, joins
-- with the changes the wages commissioner approves. ¶7: the employer
-- states its wish to join; ¶8: to the whole agreement, by each section's
-- reach. ¶9: notwithstanding §7, the cost for 5.1 is computed jointly for
-- all its employees on the Histadrut's agreements, unless agreed otherwise
-- with the trade union division's chair and, for a budgeted or supported
-- body, the wages commissioner. ¶10: the grant's first part, if unpaid, is
-- paid with the salary of the month after signing, at the latest the next.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 akn:att_2__hc_1/p14
GIVEN `months of the period its own wage agreement covers` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a budgeted body joins by the letter as printed` `months of the period its own wage agreement covers` IF
    `months of the period its own wage agreement covers` AT MOST 6

@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p7 akn:att_2__hc_1/p8 akn:att_2__hc_1/p9
`a joining employer's cost is computed jointly for all its Histadrut employees` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p10
GIVEN `the month the letter was signed` IS A NUMBER @desc counted as year × 12 + month
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the latest salary month a joining employer pays the grant's first part in` `the month the letter was signed` IS
    `the month the letter was signed` PLUS 2

§§ `נספח ג' — חוזרי הממונה על השכר על המענק החד פעמי`

-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 The State of Israel, on the circular's letterhead; no rule.
