         `2016 special-scale row` "10" (LIST 6418, 6488.54, 6602.57, 6704.28, 6822.17, 6923.21),
         `2016 special-scale row` "11" (LIST 6607, 6677.54, 6794.16, 6897.30, 7016.84, 7119.29),
         `2016 special-scale row` "12" (LIST 6894, 6964.54, 7085.09, 7190.40, 7312.45, 7417.06)

-- Every cell from 1.7.2016 is the eve's cell raised by a percentage and
-- the 2016 shekel sum of the other special scales on the same day (ב.ג):
-- 70.54 from 1.7.2016 alone, then 1.37% and 96.64 from 1.3.2017, 2.125%
-- and 149.90 from 1.1.2018, 3% and 211.63 from 1.6.2018, 3.75% and 264.53
-- from 1.12.2018 — each to the agora. F-framework-2016-a: from 1.3.2017
-- the percentage is 1.37%, not the 1.375% the annex gives the same step in
-- every other table and the land authority's ד.ב; with 1.375% every cell
-- of the column is 24 to 34 agorot higher than printed.
GIVEN r IS A `2016 special-scale row`
      rates IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      shekels IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a border-crossings row is its percentage and shekel sum` r rates shekels IF
    CONSIDER r's `the special row's cells`
    WHEN first FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        all (GIVEN t YIELD
                 CONSIDER t
                 WHEN cell FOLLOWED BY more THEN
                     (CONSIDER more
                      WHEN rate FOLLOWED BY more2 THEN
                          (CONSIDER more2
                           WHEN sh FOLLOWED BY none THEN cell `is within an agora of` ((first `increased by` rate) PLUS sh)
                           OTHERWISE FALSE)
                      OTHERWISE FALSE)
                 OTHERWISE FALSE)
            (zipWith (GIVEN c, k YIELD c FOLLOWED BY k) rest (zipWith (GIVEN a, b YIELD LIST a, b) rates shekels))
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`the special scales' 2016 shekel sums from 1.7.2016` MEANS LIST 70.54, 96.64, 149.90, 211.63, 264.53
`the border crossings' percentages as printed` MEANS LIST 0, 1.37%, 2.125%, 3%, 3.75%
`the border crossings' percentages at the defaults' steps` MEANS LIST 0, 1.375%, 2.125%, 3%, 3.75%

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD `a border-crossings row is its percentage and shekel sum` r `the border crossings' percentages as printed` `the special scales' 2016 shekel sums from 1.7.2016`) `the border crossings' basic table of 2016`

`the border crossings' March 2017 column is at 1.37%, not 1.375%` MEANS
        all (GIVEN r YIELD `a border-crossings row is its percentage and shekel sum` r `the border crossings' percentages as printed` `the special scales' 2016 shekel sums from 1.7.2016`) `the border crossings' basic table of 2016`
    AND NOT any (GIVEN r YIELD `a border-crossings row is its percentage and shekel sum` r `the border crossings' percentages at the defaults' steps` `the special scales' 2016 shekel sums from 1.7.2016`) `the border crossings' basic table of 2016`

`two of annex ד''s tables raise the March 2017 step by 1.37%` MEANS
        `the border crossings' March 2017 column is at 1.37%, not 1.375%`
    AND `the land authority's March 2017 ranges are at 1.37%, not 1.375%`

#ASSERT `two of annex ד''s tables raise the March 2017 step by 1.37%`

