-- The typing supplement follows level 5: its rise in each column is level
-- 5's, to the agora.
GIVEN `the typing supplement` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `level 5` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the typing supplement follows level 5` `the typing supplement` `level 5` IF
    CONSIDER `the typing supplement`
    WHEN s0 FOLLOWED BY srest THEN
        (CONSIDER `level 5`
         WHEN l0 FOLLOWED BY lrest THEN
             all (GIVEN pair YIELD
                      CONSIDER pair
                      WHEN s FOLLOWED BY more THEN
                          (CONSIDER more
                           WHEN l FOLLOWED BY none THEN s `is within an agora of` (s0 TIMES l DIVIDED BY l0)
                           OTHERWISE FALSE)
                      OTHERWISE FALSE)
                 (zipWith (GIVEN a, b YIELD LIST a, b) srest lrest)
         OTHERWISE FALSE)
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN rows IS A LIST OF `2016 special-scale row`
      label IS A STRING
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the cells of the special row labelled` rows label IS
    foldl (GIVEN acc, r YIELD IF r's `the special row's label` EQUALS label THEN r's `the special row's cells` ELSE acc) EMPTY rows

`the typing supplement's cells` MEANS
    foldl (GIVEN acc, r YIELD r's `the special row's cells`) EMPTY `the typing supplement of 2016`

#ASSERT `the typing supplement follows level 5` `the typing supplement's cells` (`the cells of the special row labelled` `the judges' typists' basic table of 2016` "5")

