-- ד: the land authority. ¶2: §5.4 of the agreement of 18.5.2011 on the
-- scale ("the RMI agreement") is carried out so: (א) the table of the
-- basic salary's ranges (each grade's lowest and highest) on the table's
-- days, in two parts; (ב) an employee's basic salary rises, on the days
-- below, by a share of "the employee's salary base at the authority" —
-- his basic salary on 30.6.2016 with study pay א' or ב' or management pay
-- he then had: (1) 0.5% on 1.7.2016; (2) to 1.375% on 1.3.2017; (3) to
-- 2.125% on 1.1.2018; (4) to 3% on 1.6.2018; (5) to 3.75% on 1.12.2018;
-- (ג) the 2016 shekel supplement from 1.7.2016, as for the typists; ¶3: by
-- §63יג of the Pensions Law it counts in the "salary ceiling".
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1__para_d akn:att_5__hc_1__para_d/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_d__subpara_a akn:att_5__hc_1__para_d__subpara_a/t1 akn:att_5__hc_1__para_d__subpara_a/t2
