§§ `נספח ו' — המקדם X`

-- akn:att_7__hc_1/p1 A file number; no rule.
-- akn:att_7__hc_1/p2 The signatures; no rule.

-- The table of X (§19.1.2): for each last month of actual service, from
-- 1.2013 to 11.2018, "X in all", and the cumulative X at each of the five
-- stages — July 2016 (to 1%, 13.33%), March 2017 (to 2.75%, 36.67%),
-- January 2018 (to 4.25%, 56.67%), June 2018 (to 6%, 80%) and December 2018
-- (to 7.5%, 100%) — from the first stage after the retirement on (the
-- stages before it are blank). Its other columns are each stage's part,
-- the difference of two cumulative cells. DATA, as the corpus publishes it.
@desc A row of annex ו': the last month of service, X in all, and the cumulative X at each stage after it.
DECLARE `annex ו' row` HAS
    `the row's retirement year`  IS A NUMBER
    `the row's retirement month` IS A NUMBER
    `X in all`                   IS A NUMBER
    `the cumulative X`           IS A LIST OF NUMBER

