         `annex ו' row` 2018 11 (20.0%) (LIST (20.00%))

-- The rule the table follows: a month of service in 2013–2017 earns a
-- sixtieth of the frame (to 100% at 60 months), less the share of it the
-- retiree had while serving — the frame's allocation on the first day of
-- his last month over 7.5% — and at each stage the retiree has the earned
-- share up to the share the frame has reached by then. Each printed cell is
-- that to a hundredth of a point (the parts of a stage are differences of
-- rounded cells).
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of the 2016 frame earned by` y m IS
    (IF (y MINUS 2013) TIMES 12 PLUS m GREATER THAN 60 THEN 60 ELSE (y MINUS 2013) TIMES 12 PLUS m) DIVIDED BY 60

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of the 2016 frame allocated on` d IS
    `the 2016 framework allocation on` d DIVIDED BY `the 2016 framework cost frame in all`

GIVEN d IS A DATE, y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the coefficient X of 2016 on` d `for a retiree of` y m IS
    `not below zero`
        ((IF `the share of the 2016 frame allocated on` d LESS THAN `the share of the 2016 frame earned by` y m
          THEN `the share of the 2016 frame allocated on` d
          ELSE `the share of the 2016 frame earned by` y m)
         MINUS `the share of the 2016 frame allocated on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 m y))

`the days of annex ו''s stages` MEANS
    map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `the step's day`) `the steps of the 2016 framework`

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE x `is within a hundredth of a point of` y IF
    x MINUS y AT MOST 0.0001 AND y MINUS x AT MOST 0.0001

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
DECIDE `the stages after a retirement in` y m IS
    filter (GIVEN d YIELD NOT (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 m y) `is on or after` d) `the days of annex ו''s stages`

GIVEN r IS AN `annex ו' row`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an annex ו' row follows the rule` r IF
        (r's `X in all`) `is within a hundredth of a point of` (`the coefficient X of 2016 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2018) `for a retiree of` y m)
    AND count (r's `the cumulative X`) EQUALS count (`the stages after a retirement in` y m)
    AND all (GIVEN p YIELD
                 CONSIDER p
                 WHEN cell FOLLOWED BY more THEN
                     (CONSIDER more
                      WHEN expected FOLLOWED BY none THEN cell `is within a hundredth of a point of` expected
                      OTHERWISE FALSE)
                 OTHERWISE FALSE)
            (zipWith (GIVEN a, b YIELD LIST a, b) (r's `the cumulative X`)
                     (map (GIVEN d YIELD `the coefficient X of 2016 on` d `for a retiree of` y m) (`the stages after a retirement in` y m)))
    WHERE
        y MEANS r's `the row's retirement year`
        m MEANS r's `the row's retirement month`

#ASSERT count `the rows of annex ו'` EQUALS 71
#ASSERT all `an annex ו' row follows the rule` `the rows of annex ו'`

