-- needs of them is that a dispute is in the list or not, an input of 23.1.
@ref akn:att_8__hc_1/p1 akn:att_8__hc_1/p2 akn:att_8__hc_1/t1 akn:att_8__hc_1/p4 akn:att_8__hc_1/t2 akn:att_8__hc_1/p5 akn:att_8__hc_1/t3
`the disputes annex ז' keeps pending in the State's service` MEANS 36
`the disputes annex ז' keeps pending at the NII` MEANS 1
`the disputes annex ז' keeps pending at the Employment Service` MEANS 2
`the first dispute annex ז' keeps pending in the State's service was declared on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 28 9 2008
`the last dispute annex ז' keeps pending in the State's service was declared on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 3 2016

